OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting called to discuss future
OL,4,Aof fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, in a letter to Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil's chief executive, Keighley
OL,8,FEast councillor Caroline Firth accused
OL,9,Fthe authority of failing to act, saying
OL,10,Fshe had witnessed the "devastation,
OL,11,Fpanic and fear" caused. The council has
OL,12,Fbeen approached for comment.
